Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: Union Room chunk A, drop the Missing() traps for the
 ported/stubbed Union Room manager functions (soulsilver3ds/platform/ss3ds_union.c)

Run 42: entering the Union Room aborted on [SS-MISSING] sub_02059DB0. ss3ds_union.c hand-ports the entry chain
(sub_02059DB0, sub_02059E04/E1C/E88, the SysTask sub_0205A03C ...) and stubs the rest of the Union Room manager and the comm
drivers with logging "no session" functions, so every name removed here is defined there. If missing.c is ever regenerated, drop
these names again (duplicate definitions at link).
